      {
        "id": "lzt1Uj2xW1YzIJk_",
        "title": "Figuring out how it works",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>In this lesson, you&#x27;ll start figuring out how Dataflow works.</p><p>You probably won&#x27;t know everything right away.</p><p>The <span data-slate-type=\"highlight\" data-slate-highlight-id=\"ea11c3e1-348b-46fa-9320-a0dc2c6c2ff5\"></span> for figuring things out when you don&#x27;t know them yet.</p>"
          ],
          "highlightedText": [
            {
              "id": "ea11c3e1-348b-46fa-9320-a0dc2c6c2ff5",
              "text": "goal is to develop strategies"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6LDm5Rbw-Glzndhc",
        "title": "Subtraction Machine",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>The following Dataflow program is supposed to subtract one number from another, but the blocks aren&#x27;t connected.</p><p>Right now the math tile says  ___ - ___ = ___</p><p>Drag the program to your workspace and connect the blocks so that the equation is filled in.</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
