        "title": "Making Changes to Your Program",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Now that you got the program to calculate 10 - 4.5, can you get it to calculate the opposite: 4.5 - 10?</p>"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "8TAmvtt8-nD8xa12",
        "title": "Class Discussion!",
        "content": {
          "type": "Text",
          "format": "html",
          "text": [
            "<p>Once you figured out a way to calculate 4.5 - 10, find a group who figured out a different way.</p><p>Drag this question tile over and explain what your group figured out and what their group figured out.</p><p></p><p><span data-slate-type=\"highlight\" data-slate-highlight-id=\"ef62d01d-c79e-4bff-82fb-2c6c8d67bc3e\"></span></p>"
